#: confusb/kb.py:17
msgid "PC/SC service and CCID drivers"
msgstr "PC/SC-teenus ja CCID-draiverid"

#: confusb/kb.py:18
msgid ""
"pcscd is the daemon that manages smart card readers; libccid provides the "
"driver for standard USB readers (CCID). Without pcscd the reader shows up in "
"USB but no application can use it."
msgstr ""
"pcscd on deemon, mis haldab kiipkaardilugejaid; libccid pakub draiverit "
"standardsetele USB-lugejatele (CCID). Ilma pcscd-ta on lugeja USB-s nähtav, "
"kuid ükski rakendus ei saa seda kasutada."

#: confusb/kb.py:22
msgid "OpenSC (PKCS#11, supports DNIe and other cards)"
msgstr "OpenSC (PKCS#11, toetab DNIe-d ja muid kaarte)"

#: confusb/kb.py:23
msgid ""
"Library and tools for cryptographic cards. It includes support for the DNIe "
"(3.0/4.0) and the PKCS#11 module used by Firefox/Chromium and AutoFirma. "
"Older DNIe cards (2.0) may need the official DNIe module."
msgstr ""
"Teek ja tööriistad krüptograafiliste kaartide jaoks. Sisaldab DNIe (3.0/4.0) "
"tuge ja PKCS#11 moodulit, mida kasutavad Firefox/Chromium ja AutoFirma. "
"Vanemad DNIe-d (2.0) võivad vajada ametlikku DNIe moodulit."

#: confusb/kb.py:26
msgid "List readers"
msgstr "Loetle lugejad"

#: confusb/kb.py:27
msgid "Card info (ATR)"
msgstr "Kaardi teave (ATR)"

#: confusb/kb.py:28
msgid "List PKCS#11 slots"
msgstr "Loetle PKCS#11 pesad"

#: confusb/kb.py:29
msgid "List certificates"
msgstr "Loetle sertifikaadid"

#: confusb/kb.py:34
msgid "pcsc-tools (reader and card monitor)"
msgstr "pcsc-tools (lugejate ja kaartide monitor)"

#: confusb/kb.py:35
msgid ""
"pcsc_scan shows in real time when a card is inserted or removed and decodes "
"its ATR."
msgstr ""
"pcsc_scan näitab reaalajas, millal kaart sisestatakse või eemaldatakse, ning "
"dekodeerib selle ATR-i."

#: confusb/kb.py:37
msgid "Open pcsc_scan"
msgstr "Ava pcsc_scan"

#: confusb/kb.py:40
msgid "AutoFirma (electronic signature)"
msgstr "AutoFirma (digiallkiri)"

#: confusb/kb.py:41
msgid ""
"Official Spanish Government application to sign documents with the DNIe or a "
"digital certificate. It is not in the Debian repositories: it is downloaded "
"from firmaelectronica.gob.es."
msgstr ""
"Hispaania valitsuse ametlik rakendus dokumentide allkirjastamiseks DNIe või "
"digitaalse sertifikaadiga. Seda pole Debiani hoidlates: see laaditakse alla "
"aadressilt firmaelectronica.gob.es."

